Followups to the main list.

At the last chaos communication congress we had Seraphine551 give us our
very own hand puppets. Ever since then we wanted to make a video with
them. Today (or rather yesterday), this dream finally became realized
and we turned the dead parrot sketch into hand puppetry. Even though
there were a few hiccups and the text still contains at least two
grammatical mistakes, we are rather happy with the result, which you can
watch on YouTube[1] (even with subtitles, if you wish.)

